--   admin@hosifest.test     / DevAdmin!2024     -> ADMIN
--   finance@hosifest.test   / DevFinance!2024   -> FINANCE
--   checkin@hosifest.test   / DevCheckin!2024   -> ATTENDANCE
--   souvenir@hosifest.test  / DevSouvenir!2024  -> ADMIN (maps to ADMIN because rbac.ts has no SOUVENIR role)
--
-- !! PRODUCTION WARNING !!
-- These accounts MUST NOT be loaded in production. Delete these rows or rotate
-- the passwords before any production deploy. Do not commit real credentials.

